=== CRITICAL BUG FIX APPLIED ===
Bug: convertToMM=true multiplied already-mm coordinates by 1000
Result: Coordinates became 52 million instead of 32mm
Fix: Added 'false' parameter to 4 locations in mesh_processing_headless.cpp:
  - Line 399: writeMatrix_to_XYZ(..., 3, false)
  - Line 1511: writeMatrix_to_XYZ(..., 6, false)
  - Line 2025: convertPLYtoXYZ(..., false)
  - Line 2032: convertPLYtoXYZ(..., false)

